. 
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. * Simulation at chosen coefficients, without any estimation.
. * theta() is in the order of the coefficient table: outdegree,
. * reciprocity, transtrip; rates() has one rate per period.
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------
. nwsaom simulate, waves(glasgow1 glasgow2) outdegree reciprocity transtrip theta(-2.7 2.4 0.6) rate
> s(6) nsim(100) seed(5)
Simulation from the fitted model: 100 replication(s) of 1 period(s).
Mean over replications (observed end wave in brackets):
period          ties      mutual    transitive    behavior
1          105.4 ( 116)    33.9 (  35)      72.6 (  88)

